OL,3,GNEWSAFood banks 'in crisis' amid fears
OL,4,Asome may have to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe manager of a food bank in County
OL,7,FFermanagh has said they have enough
OL,8,Fmoney for "two months of running costs"
OL,9,Fbefore they run out, while another one
OL,10,Fin West Belfast, has had to
OL,11,F"significantly reduce" the sizes of
OL,12,Ftheir parcels.
OL,14,FAccording to the Trussell Trust, an
OL,15,Fanti-poverty charity, some food banks
OL,16,Fare having pay for 30-50% of the food
OL,17,Fthey are supplying.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
