OL,3,GNEWSAFood banks 'in crisis' amid fears
OL,4,Asome may have to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnniskillen Foodbank said their
OL,7,F"ongoing expenses are continuing and
OL,8,Fdonations are not keeping pace" with
OL,9,Fproject manager Paul Dickson describing
OL,10,Fit as it a "bleak situation".
OL,12,FEdel Diamond from South-West Belfast
OL,13,FFoodbank on the Stewartstown Road said
OL,14,Fthey are struggling with stock which is
OL,15,F"really upsetting because you've got
OL,16,Ffamilies coming to you that aren't
OL,17,Freally coping".
